<p id="S2.F3.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center ltx_align_center"><span id="S2.F3.1.1" class="ltx_text"><img src="2509.21356v1/revisedfigs/smallpic.png" id="S2.F3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:499/185;" width="499" height="185" alt="Refer to caption"></span></p>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Illustration of error detection and localization for 5 sentences from reports generated by X-rayGPT<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib24" title="" class="ltx_ref">24</a>]</cite>. The legend for bounding boxes: predicted finding location: Green, indicated finding: orange, ground truth finding: red. </figcaption>
</figure>
